      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "could not wait to get over but phoned first and then came over to have me send the enrollment card. You know better than I what resulted. But why all such details? I simply want to put you \"wise\" against poisonous intimations regarding Rae Garland, on the part of a certain prominent party\" who had a big share in the robbing of Garland of his cemetery, the Mt. Vernon Memorial Park. This of course is coming too late to save Garland his employ- ment, but if you find out the truth about him as I know it, and about said prominent party who has knocked him before, you'll realize something of what you've lost in dropping such a promising employee. But more than this, you will know what to do without hesitation if occasionally you have an opportunity to do him and me a favor.",
